    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'High Protein Epic Breakfast Burrito Recipe', N'Breakfast', N'It''s not quite Taco Tuesday, but you can still get your fill of Mexican cuisine! Give this epic recipe for high protein breakfast burritos a shot!', 598, 68, 41, 18, NULL, 1, 10011, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/high-protein-breakfast-burritos', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/breakfast-burrito-feature.jpg', N'Makes 2 servings', N'In a bowl, whisk together eggs and egg whites Spray a skillet with nonstick spray Scramble eggs (with salt & pepper, if using) over medium heat until desired doneness While eggs are cooking, dice up red pepper, green pepper and onion When eggs are done, remove from pan and cover Add ground beef and taco seasoning to skillet Cook beef until done Lay burrito or tortilla on a plate Layer scrambled eggs, peppers, onion, ground beef and then finish off with a sprinkle of cheese Wrap up and enjoy with a side of fresh fruit! Notes: *This recipe makes a great Sunday meal prep! Simply wrap burritos in tin foil and place in freezer (once cooled). Remove from the freezer before heading out the door for the day! **You can mix and match flavors with this recipe by: a) adding in salsa and avocado for a Mexican burrito b) using Italian herbs in place of taco seasoning and adding in marinara sauce and mozzarella c) using buffalo sauce in place of taco seasoning and adding in blue cheese for a buffalo wrap The possibilities are endless!', N'["High Protein Recipes","Breakfast Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"598","protein_g":"68","carbs_g":"41","fat_g":"18"}', 106600);
END
