    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'High Protein Balsamic Steak & Pasta Salad Recipe', N'Lunch', N'This high protein steak & pasta salad recipe is perfect as a main dish or a side at your next bbq! It is also easy enough to make a large batch on meal prep Sunday to enjoy throughout the week!', 394, 43, 39, 10, NULL, 1, 10040, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/high-protein-balsamic-steak-pasta-salad', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/high-protein-balsamic-steak-pasta-salad-recipe-featured.jpg', N'Serves 4 as a main dish or 6 as a side. Nutritional information is for 1 of 4 servings.', N'Slice steak into thin strips and grill until desired doneness Toss together cooked pasta, asparagus, tomato, balsamic, and seasonings Add in cooked steak and goat cheese Toss gently Serve immediately or store in a sealed container until ready to enjoy! Notes You can sub the Banza for regular whole grain pasta; however, this will decrease the protein and slightly increase the carbs You can leave the asparagus raw for crunch or slightly blanch, if desired', N'["High Protein Recipes","Lunch Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"394","protein_g":"43","carbs_g":"39.3","fat_g":"9.5"}', 49400);
