    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'High Protein Chipotle Cheddar Vegetarian Quesadilla Recipe', N'Lunch', N'Grill up a cheesy, protein packed veggie quesadilla for a quick switch up to your normal BBQ food! Eating meat free doesn’t have to mean no protein!', 287, 33, 30, 11, NULL, 1, 10060, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/high-protein-vegetarian-quesadilla', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/chipotle-cheddar-veggie-quesadilla-featured.jpg', N'Serves 4 Nutrition Facts reflect use of a low carb tortilla', N'Add sliced pepper, onion and mushroom to grill pan and grill until tender Mix together cottage cheese and chipotle seasoning Lay tortilla flat on grill Spread half with cottage cheese, veggies and then top with cheddar cheese Cook opened with grill cover down for 2 minutes Fold tortilla over and flip (gently) Cook another 1-2 minutes or until cheese is melted Slice and serve with salsa *A low carb tortilla will not crisp and firm up as well as a regular or P28 tortilla', N'["High Protein Recipes","Vegetarian Recipes","Lunch Recipes","BBQ/Grill Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"287","protein_g":"32.6","carbs_g":"29.8","fat_g":"10.6"}', 37600);
