    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Gameday High Protein Buffalo Dip Recipe', N'Snack', N'No need to fall off track on game day! This simple and protein packed Buffalo Chicken Dip packs all the flavor of regular dip, but without all the fat!', 169, 24, 3, 6, NULL, 1, 10070, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/high-protein-buffalo-chicken-dip', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/healthy_buffalo_dip_recipe_for_gameday_snack.jpg', N'Makes 8 Servings.', N'Add cottage cheese, cream cheese, mozzarella and buffalo sauce to a sauce pan. Place over low heat and mix continuously until cheeses are melted and combined. Add in shredded chicken. Mix well. Place in serving dish and top with crumbled blue cheese. Optional Dippers: Celery, Carrots, Corn Tortillas, Pretzels, Just a spoon for a very low carb treat! Macronutrients with ½ cup each celery/carrots: Calories: 203 Protein: 25g Carb: 10g Fat: 6g Macronutrients with 1oz Tortilla Chips: Calories: 319 Protein: 26g Carbs: 21g Fat: 14g Macronutrients with 1oz Pretzels: Calories: 279 Protein: 26g Carbs: 27g Fat: 7g Notes: *You can make a large batch and store in a sealed container. It reheats well in an oven safe dish. *Leftovers make a great topping on shredded lettuce, mixed into pasta or even over brown rice for a complete protein packed meal!', N'["Snack Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"169","protein_g":"24","carbs_g":"3","fat_g":"6"}', 32500);
