    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'High-Protein White Chocolate Raspberry Pancakes Recipe', N'Breakfast', N'This easy recipe puts a delicious and protein-filled twist on pancakes, that will not only having your mouth thanking you, but your muscles as well.', 278, 15, 36, 10, NULL, 1, 10106, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/white-chocolate-raspberry-pancakes', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/image/recipe/white_chocolate_raspberry_pancakes_feature.jpg', N'Makes about 6-8 small pancakes, 2 stacks.', N'Combine the FlapJacked Protein Pancake Mix with water and mix. Gently mix 1/4 cup of raspberries into the pancake batter. Cook pancakes according to directions on the FlapJacked package. Melt the CocoNutter and drizzle each stack of pancakes with 1/2 tbs of Sweet Spreads CocoNutter. Evenly divide remaining raspberries between top of each stack, and if desired top of stacks with a cut-up Quest Bar.', N'["Breakfast Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"278, w/Quest Bar: 373","protein_g":"15.4g, w/Quest Bar: 25.4","carbs_g":"36.2g, w/Quest Bar: 47.7","fat_g":"9.7g, w/Quest Bar: 13.7"}', 20200);
