    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Grilled Chipotle Shrimp Tacos With Cilantro Avocado Dressing Recipe', N'Lunch', N'Finish off the summer season the right way! Fire up the grill and test out this grilled chipotle grilled shrimp with cilantro avocado dressing recipe!', 437, 45, 44, 9, NULL, 1, 10129, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/grilled-chipotle-shrimp-tacos-recipe', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/shrimp-tacos-feature.jpg', N'Makes 2 Servings. 1 Serving = 4 tacos', N'Heat grill to around 300 degrees Spray grill with non stick grill spray or toss shrimp with ½ tbs olive oil Place shrimp on the grilled and cook for about 3 minutes Flip shrimp and cook an additional 2-3 minutes or until pink in color When shrimp are done cooking, season with chipotle seasoning Evenly divide the chopped cabbage, shrimp, avocado and dressing among 8 corn tortillas Enjoy! Notes: *Feel free to also grill your tortillas for an even more authentic summer time taco! *You can easily swap the shrimp for a vegetarian or vegan friendly protein choice such as beans or tofu.', N'["Lunch Recipes","Dinner Recipes","BBQ/Grill Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"437","protein_g":"45","carbs_g":"44","fat_g":"9"}', 17400);
END
