    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Baked Apple Cider Pronuts (Protein Donuts) Recipe', N'Snack', N'Yes, you can enjoy all of those fall treats! This Apple Cider Pronut recipe is not only simple, but healthy, protein packed and has only 1g of sugar!', 132, 8, 18, 5, NULL, 1, 10139, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/baked-apple-cider-pronuts-protein-donuts', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/pronuts_1.jpg', N'Serves 6. Nutrition facts reflect 1 out of 6 servings without optional coating.', N'Preheat oven to 330 degrees Spray a donut pan with non stick spray Whisk together dry ingredients: protein powder, oat flour, coconut flour, xylitol, cinnamon, nutmeg and baking powder Melt 1 tbs butter and combine with eggs, apple cider and apple sauce Mix together wet and dry ingredients Evenly divide batter between 6 donut molds Bake for ~12 minutes or until slightly golden *Optional: Melt 2 tbs butter Dip donut into melted butter Coat with additional sweetener Notes: *Can substitute with favorite cinnamon protein powder OR vanilla protein powder with additional 1 tsp ground cinnamon', N'["Snack Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"132","protein_g":"8","carbs_g":"18","fat_g":"5"}', 16100);
END
