    SuggestedMonth=NULL, IsSystemDefault=1, SortOrder=10147, SourceUrl=N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/chorizo-veggie-quiche', ImageUrl=N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/cvq_feature.jpg', ServingSuggestion=N'Makes 6 Large Quiche.', ContentText=N'Preheat oven to 375 degrees. Coat 6 large muffin cups with nonstick spray.** Heat a skillet over medium heat. Cook chorizo, onion and shredded potato. In a bowl, whisk together eggs, egg whites, cottage cheese, salt & pepper. Add meat, onion, potato and broccoli to eggs. Evenly divide among 6 cups. Bake for 40-45 minutes. Allow to cool and then gently remove from mold. Notes: *Can sub with ground turkey breast if following a lower fat meal plan. If using ground turkey, add your favorite no salt seasoning to replace the flavor from the chorizo. **Can also use 12 regular size muffin cups. Use approximately half the cooking time.', CategoriesJson=N'["Breakfast Recipes"]', SourceMacrosJson=N'{"calories_kcal":"239.6","protein_g":"18.6","carbs_g":"11.6","fat_g":"13.2"}', ReadCount=15300
    WHERE MealSuggestionId=@ImportedMealSuggestionId;
