    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Soft Serve Protein Ice Cream Recipe', N'Snack', N'Time to try a guilt-free, high protein ice cream recipe that you will love! All you need is whey protein, almond milk, ice and salt. 26 grams of protein and only 170 calories.', 170, 26, 9, 2, NULL, 1, 10163, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/soft-serve-protein-ice-cream-recipe', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/image/recipe/ice-cream-450.jpg', N'Makes one serving.', N'Add the protein and milk to the small ziplock - mix it a bit and zip closed. Place the smaller ziplock into the larger one full of ice. Pour salt into the big bag [but NOT into the ingredient one!] Now SHAKE WHATCHA MOMMA GAVE YA! Shake for about 2-4 minutes until frozen. Maaaybe you should wear gloves, cuz it gets COLDDDD. And viola! Soft serve ice cream :] Feel free to add toppings like fruit, peanut butter, cocoa to make it chocolate, nuts, coconut shreds, etc.', N'["Snack Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"170","protein_g":"26","carbs_g":"9","fat_g":"2.5"}', 13100);
END
