    Title=N'Peach Mango Protein Soft Serve Recipe', MealType=N'Snack', Description=N'Beat the summer heat with this refreshing treat! A high protein peach mango soft serve recipe that is macro-friendly, nutritious, and satisfyingly sweet!', CaloriesKcal=355, ProteinG=35, CarbsG=42, FatsG=4,
    SuggestedMonth=NULL, IsSystemDefault=1, SortOrder=10197, SourceUrl=N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/peach-mango-protein-soft-serve', ImageUrl=N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/peach-mango-feature.jpg', ServingSuggestion=N'Macros reflect entire recipe using 1 scoop of protein powder. One serving of this protein froyo is 474g. A serving of low fat ice cream in the same amount would be approximately*: 10g fat 84g carbs 12g protein *This would vary depending on brand and flavor', ContentText=N'Add protein powder and greek yogurt to food processor Blend until combined (scraped down sides, if needed) Add in frozen fruit Pulse** in food processor until combined (you can pulse until all fruit is blended in or leave chunks of the fruit for more texture) Serve immediately for a creamy, frozen yogurt like texture or freeze for up to 1 hour for a more ice cream like texture Top with more diced fruit and shredded coconut, if desired Notes: *You can also use already frozen fruit. **Do not hit ‘blend’. It will shut your food processor down. Please ensure to ‘pulse’.', CategoriesJson=N'["High Protein Recipes","Snack Recipes"]', SourceMacrosJson=N'{"calories_kcal":"355","protein_g":"35","carbs_g":"42","fat_g":"4"}', ReadCount=8500
    WHERE MealSuggestionId=@ImportedMealSuggestionId;
